Error [E0120]: `label` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> copies_explicit_param_field.jet:11:16
    |
 11 |     User{name: label, tags: [String]{}}
    |                ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `~label`
